  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "The Camera class manages the 3D rendering view by calculating the necessary view and projection matrices. It supports both PERSPECTIVE and ORTHOGRAPHIC projection modes, handling coordinate transformations between world space and 2D screen space. It acts as a core scene entity, providing methods for raycasting (screenToWorldRay) and state serialization/deserialization."
  },
